  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39619148",
      "title": "Fixing Errors with Copilot Chat",
      "sourceHash": "b6c4b64017c8fe69e62a4c30c5b306243287208d7f8fcc4c343b58fe86367c0d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.93,
          "end": 2.7,
          "en": "Now GitHub Copilot Chat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.7,
          "end": 4.68,
          "en": "cannot just be used to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 8.883,
          "en": "generate new code, but also to fix existing code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "For example, here I might have a typo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 16.503,
          "en": "in this line of code, a typo which I didn't spot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "Now, if your code fails to run, you can always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 24.78,
          "en": "select the part of the code which you think is responsible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.78,
          "end": 27.75,
          "en": "So maybe like this entire code, because you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.75,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "think that somewhere in here you have an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 35.07,
          "en": "and you can then run the GitHub Copilot \"fix this\" command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.07,
          "end": 39.75,
          "en": "and it'll then analyze this code and try to find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.75,
          "end": 43.113,
          "en": "a potential problem and a fix for that problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "And the great thing is that in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 49.38,
          "en": "it will not go ahead and make that change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.38,
          "end": 53.22,
          "en": "but instead it will suggest some change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "Here you see the old code on the left",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "and then the new code that could be used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 63.06,
          "en": "if you accept that change, on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.06,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "And it highlights the part that was changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "and if you're not happy with some parts that were changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 73.443,
          "en": "you could also revert parts of the suggested change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 75.69,
          "en": "And then once you're happy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.69,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "you can click \"accept\" to accept the change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "so that here it fixed this typo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.93,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "And of course, it's not limited to fixing typos.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "Instead it can detect and fix a broad variety",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 92.1,
          "en": "of errors and it therefore might be a huge help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.1,
          "end": 93.543,
          "en": "in your day-to-day work.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 314,
      "videoOrder": 314
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
